<mxCell id="c27" value="The endpoint runs the assignment's fixed equality check against configured strings (APP_USER_USERNAME / APP_USER_PASSWORD from the gitignored .env; defaults user / password in dev/test).&#10;It is separate from the BCrypt in-memory store used by HTTP Basic (user/user123 · admin/admin123) and from JWT role mapping. Token expiry is 3,600,000 ms (1 h) in dev/test profiles." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica Neue;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1A1B1C;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
